SUMMARY:Summertime 5 à 7 - R-Ladies Ottawa
DESCRIPTION:Connect with fellow data enthusiasts in a relaxed, casual setting. Drop by anytime! A variety of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages, along with food, will be available for purchase. Please note that participants are responsible for their own tabs.\n\nSeating is limited so please only RSVP if you're planning to join us in person. If your plans change, kindly cancel your RSVP so others can take your spot. We appreciate it!\n\n⚠️ **Please note that the mission of R-Ladies+ is to increase gender diversity in the R community. This event is intended to provide a safe space for women and gender minorities. We ask for male allies to be invited by and accompanied by a woman or gender minority.**
LOCATION:Braumeister Bierhalle, 175 Carruthers Ave, Ottawa, CANADA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-ottawa/events/315412315/
